# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>
#
# Trailing-slash variants are listed explicitly. Cloudflare normalises /x to /x/
# with a 308 *before* matching, and a bare /x rule does not catch the result;
# a wildcard (/x/*) does, but a single-segment pattern (/x/:y) does not.
#
# /archive was a second view of the same posts as /posts, and /tags let you
# browse them by tag. Both are gone: /posts is a plain timeline of everything,
# so every removed URL lands there.
/archive /posts 301
/archive/ /posts 301
/archive/* /posts 301
/tags /posts 301
/tags/ /posts 301
/tags/* /posts 301
/search /posts 301
/search/ /posts 301
/search/* /posts 301
